WEBVTT

00:06:58.463 --> 00:07:00.463
and even in avatar fashion shows.

00:07:01.163 --> 00:07:03.763
Take the pioneer 18-year-old FEWOCiOUS,

00:07:03.797 --> 00:07:08.397
who was way ahead of Gucci,
with his crypto art and digital sneakers.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:11.163
The use of augmented
and virtual-reality fashion

00:07:11.163 --> 00:07:12.430
is becoming mainstream,

00:07:12.463 --> 00:07:16.897
but because NFTs as art
and collectibles are so new,

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:20.463
the predictions are too volatile
for anyone to make.

00:07:21.097 --> 00:07:25.863
But it is a sign that heavy hitters
like Mark Cuban and Snoop Dogg

00:07:25.897 --> 00:07:27.363
are investing heavily.

00:07:27.797 --> 00:07:30.597
This is the new frontier
for artists and their fans.